// The app target's base configuration. Universal Links (ui/deep-links) need a development team and the associated-domains
// entitlement, which the ad-hoc "Sign to Run Locally" build can't carry, so they are on only when scripts/dev.sh has written
// Local.xcconfig (gitignored) from activitytracker.appleTeamId: DEVELOPMENT_TEAM, APP_LINK_HOST (the AppView's public host) and
// CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS = Config/AppLinks.entitlements. Without it the build is unchanged, and activitytracker:// links open the app.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
